        {
          "text": " Naarai inera kwanata EJAKAIT nuka Salum okoku loka Yosia, ekabaka loka Yuda, loerumit aibois naka Yosia papake, loanyouni kaibois kana ebe:” Mam bobo eboŋuni nee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
