        {
          "text": " Ebala EJAKAIT ebe, “Kwape ajaria, karaida kerai Konia okoku loka Yekoiakim, ekabaka loka Yuda, egilut lokapolou kakanika nakoteten, ti kautoo jo; ",
          "type": "text",
